  "details": "The new update build 920 just released at April 18th fixed cam filters and other fixes for more stability.\nBut!\nThis build has another bug, causing all world player counters are not more working and stay now at 00, no matter how many players joined.\nThat means also we will not see how many players are in the world. This is not great.\nWorld player counters is used in many worlds. It worked until build 919.\nThey are also useful to see if world is not empty.",
